    - Option 1 – Partial Demand Deferral (Preferred): Defer approximately 20% of the incremental demand to the next available production window. All current constraint limits (FatigueIndex ≤ 0.40, Noise ≤ 80.0 dB) remain fully enforced. Negotiate a revised delivery schedule with the customer or fulfil from safety stock where available. This is the only option that requires zero relaxation of human-centric constraints and eliminates all risk of worker harm.
